 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種と NC State・種: 地下茎と種で aggressively に広がり、放置すると大きな群落になる。地下茎による広がりなので種の記述を品種に当てた（品種の文は stauden.de の「必要なら広がりを抑える」のみ）。ほかに晩春の切り詰め（MBG・種）、花後の強い切り戻し（Walters・品種）の記述あり",
  "management_type_quote": "Plants spread aggressively by rhizomes and self-seeding, and can naturalize into substantial colonies if left unchecked.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "強",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/種] Plants also tolerate hot, humid summers and drought.\n[Walters/品種] Heat tolerant.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] Plants spread aggressively by rhizomes and self-seeding, and can naturalize into substantial colonies if left unchecked.\n[地下茎 3／NC State・種] Plants can spread aggressively by rhizomes and seeds and are easily divided.\n[地下茎の食い違い] MBG は 2 相当、stauden.de は 2 相当",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[MBG・種] May spread somewhat aggressively.",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[Walters・品種] This selection produces showy clusters of cherry-red flowers over a bushy mound of ferny green leaves.",
  "sources_with_cultivar_page": "RHS、stauden.de、Walters、Jelitto",
  "sources_used": "Jelitto、MBG、NC State、RHS、Walters、stauden.de"
 }
